{"steamAppId":362930,"description":"Use your best driving skills and the bonus objects to be first across the finish line! But watch out... it's a free-for-all out there!\n\n16 DIFFERENT CIRCUITS — stunning 3D environments from the world of Garfield (Garfield's neighborhood, the city, the Mally supermarket, the sunny farm, the misty docks, the oasis, the dark manor house, etc.)\n\n8 CHARACTERS — Garfield, Odie, Jon, Nermal, Arlene, Liz, Harry and Squeak.\n\n8 BONUSES for some crazy attacks and defenses (Exploding Diamonds, Lasagnas, Pies, Magic Wand, Pillow, Bewitching Perfume, Flying Saucers)\n\n3 GAME MODES: Grand Prix / Single Race / Time Trial\n\n3 DIFFICULTY LEVELS: 50cc, 100 cc and 150 cc\n\nDAILY CHALLENGE: Try out a new challenge every day!\n\nCUSTOMIZE your characters with tons of hoods and accessories","short_description":"Join Garfield and his friends in the funniest fast and fur-ious game! What character do you want to play with? Garfield, Odie, Jon, Nermal... you choose! Take part in no-holds-barred crazy races.","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/362930/header.jpg?t=1790086534","developer":"Artefacts Studio","publisher":"Microids","genre":"Гонки","platforms":["Windows","macOS"],"modes":["Один игрок"],"playerCount":32,"releaseLabel":"16 окт. 2015 г.","comingSoon":false,"metacritic":null,"metacriticUrl":null,"steam":87,"steamReviewCount":14155,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/362930/ss_60d8a972681b666be86d3ffe85232ff2df42bd3a.600x338.jpg?t=1790086534","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/362930/ss_60d8a972681b666be86d3ffe85232ff2df42bd3a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790086534"},{"id":1,"image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/362930/ss_410d650eac6ef84fea23846319c3836be1b77544.600x338.jpg?t=1790086534","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/362930/ss_